{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">香港小姐2026｜《2026香港小姐競選決賽》日前圓滿結束，新一屆港姐冠軍袁絲珩（Bernice）帶領亞軍鄧匡閔（Ada）、雙料季軍李澤欣（Scarlett）以及「友誼小姐」李澄晴（Chorie）請客，相約同屆港姐一同歡聚慶功。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f1652854-9b2c-4782-949c-defd013165dc.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026sB53mq468z1788512194.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f1652854-9b2c-4782-949c-defd013165dc.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">一班港姐日前紛紛在社交平台上載慶功短片，從片段中可見，眾人相約在K房內一邊打邊爐一邊唱歌，枱上更擺滿刺身等多款美食，場面相當豐盛。根據她們曬出的帳單顯示，當晚這頓慶功宴花費近12,000元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"eb427c26-1698-4146-a1c3-59015cfe846c.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/202698Yvsgg03A1788512194.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"eb427c26-1698-4146-a1c3-59015cfe846c.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0f9ff742-b4a7-4b1b-8643-3b95e01dc15c.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026ZlGFG5ldkN1788512194.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0f9ff742-b4a7-4b1b-8643-3b95e01dc15c.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">同屆佳麗譚雅文（Tiffany）及魏欣（Etherine）等人亦有上載短片，並留言感謝四位：「多謝港姐請客～」期間她們鬼馬地大玩加冕儀式。聚會尾聲，眾人齊齊合照留念，盡顯同屆佳麗之間的深厚姊妹情。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-05T09:21:16.827568+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":309,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}